-#### ✅ ALWAYS Use Parameterized Queries
-```typescript
-// Safe - parameterized query
-const { data } = await supabase
-  .from('users')
-  .select('*')
-  .eq('email', userEmail)
-
-// Or with raw SQL
-await db.query(
-  'SELECT * FROM users WHERE email = $1',
